      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the maximum daily dose in the FDA labeling (3,200 mg/day). The usual single-dose maximum is 800 mg.\n\nPlease confirm the intended regimen. For example:\n- **800 mg PO QID** (3,200 mg/day, the labeled maximum)\n- **1600 mg PO TID** (4,800 mg/day, still above the labeled maximum)\n- **1600 mg PO BID** (3,200 mg/day)\n- Another dose, if you intend something specific for this patient\n\nIf you confirm the 1600 mg QID dose as written, I can enter it, but I'd want you to be sure of that choice given the GI bleeding, renal, and cardiovascular risks at that dose. Please also tell me the indication, and whether you want a duration or a PRN note added."
      }
     ],
